  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Pre-heat the oven to 350F. Gather and prep all ingredients. Powder the erythritol (for the filling) using a spice grinder or a food processor. Zest and juice the lemons.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-simple-5-ingredient-keto-lemon-bars/#wprm-recipe-54829-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Super-Simple-5-Ingredient-Keto-Lemon-Bars-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the crust by mixing together almond flour, erythritol, and butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-simple-5-ingredient-keto-lemon-bars/#wprm-recipe-54829-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Super-Simple-5-Ingredient-Keto-Lemon-Bars-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon the crust mixture into a parchment-lined ramekin, casserole dish, or muffin tray and press against the bottom to make a smooth surface. Bake in the oven for 15-20 minutes or until the crust is golden brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-simple-5-ingredient-keto-lemon-bars/#wprm-recipe-54829-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Super-Simple-5-Ingredient-Keto-Lemon-Bars-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "As the crust cools some, start on the filling. Whisk together the eggs, powdered erythritol, almond flour, lemon juice, lemon zest, and a pinch of salt. Mix until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-simple-5-ingredient-keto-lemon-bars/#wprm-recipe-54829-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Super-Simple-5-Ingredient-Keto-Lemon-Bars-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the lemon filling onto the semi-cooled crust and return to the oven, baking for 15-20 minutes. The center should be slightly jiggly but the top set completely. If you overbake it, it will crack.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-simple-5-ingredient-keto-lemon-bars/#wprm-recipe-54829-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Super-Simple-5-Ingredient-Keto-Lemon-Bars-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the bars in the refrigerator for 3-5 hours to cool completely and firm up. Optionally dust with additional powdered erythritol and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-simple-5-ingredient-keto-lemon-bars/#wprm-recipe-54829-step-0-5",
